    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1649">

                <pb facs="1047" n="931" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg931"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 511.4A1/1480.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Delegate Van Dyke.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your June 20. The Department does not believe that the situation will be improved
                    by putting the Convention into effect among a limited number of powers. If it
                    seems advisable, you may endeavor to adjourn Conference, letting the Conference
                    request the Governments of the United States and the Netherlands to use their
                    best efforts in the meanwhile to secure the signatures of Turkey, Greece and
                    Serbia, on the understanding that the Conference will reassemble on August
                    15.</p>
                <p>The hesitation of the Conference to put the Convention into effect is seriously
                    embarrassing the passage of the fourth and final anti-narcotic bill, now in the
                    Senate, which was designed to carry out the terms of the Opium Convention.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
